  "description": "Professional HTTP-based SDK for TAF Metadata Service. v8.0.0: BREAKING CHANGES - Removed includeQueries parameter from GetAppObjectAsync (queries no longer embedded in AppObject). Added dedicated Query endpoints: GetQueryByIdAsync and GetQueryByNameAsync returning QueryResponse with AppObjectName field. Query responses NOT wrapped in OperationResult for simplified consumption. Database column renamed: queriesjson to configuration. v7.4.0: Added includeQueries parameter to GetAppObjectAsync. v7.3.0: Added GetQueryByNameAsync for JSONB configuration. v7.2.0: Connection endpoints return shared Connection model. Features Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, explicit Context parameter support, comprehensive error handling, screen management, batch relations support, and GUID-based lookups.",
